## SQ-TN-11 | a TNT minecart burst no longer breaks nearby minecarts and armor stands; mobs still take hits
@group A
@commands Ring of 8 minecarts, 8 armor stands and 8 NoAI zombies 10 blocks from a TNT minecart at X 2000 (outside the blast, inside the 12-block shrapnel reach); the cart explodes (`TNTFuse:1`); count the survivors
@pass 8 minecarts and 8 armor stands left; LOOK: some zombies below 20 health (hit); no `creativecompat:shrapnel` left after 2 s
@fails fewer carts or stands: `ShrapnelEntity.canHitEntity` still hits non-living entities (or `hitsNonLiving` is true in the toml); no zombie hit: the filter drops living targets too
> forceload add 1984 -16 2016 16
> kill @e[x=1984,y=-64,z=-16,dx=32,dy=20,dz=32,type=!minecraft:player]
> fill 1984 -60 -16 2016 -50 16 minecraft:air
> execute positioned 2010.5 -60 0.5 run summon minecraft:minecart ~ ~ ~
> execute positioned 1990.5 -60 0.5 run summon minecraft:minecart ~ ~ ~
