## CQ-TN-13 | a burning TNT item hurts about half as much and knocks back as before
@group client
@commands Survival, full health, no armor, Normal difficulty: throw one TNT into a lit campfire 2 blocks away and stand still; note the health lost and how far you are pushed; repeat with `[shrapnel] itemBlastDamageFactor = 1.0` (config screen) and compare
@pass at 0.5 the health lost is about half of the 1.0 run (shrapnel hits come on top: stand on the far side of a wall from the ring, or set `count = 0` for both runs); the push looks the same
@fails same damage: `BurnBlastDamage.onHurt` not registered (`CreativeCompat` event bus); no push: knockback depends on the damage (it should not, `Explosion#explode` applies it apart)
@draft no batch holds this row yet; needs a client
